  "starter": "-- Write your SQL query below\n\n",
  "statementHtml": "\n<p>Table: <code>UserActivity</code></p>\n<div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Column Name</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>username</td><td>varchar</td></tr><tr><td>activity</td><td>varchar</td></tr><tr><td>startDate</td><td>Date</td></tr><tr><td>endDate</td><td>Date</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>This table may contain duplicates rows.<br/>This table contains information about the activity performed by each user in a period of time.<br/>A person with username performed an activity from startDate to endDate.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Write a solution to show the <strong>second most recent activity</strong> of each user.</p>\n<p>If the user only has one activity, return that one. A user cannot perform more than one activity at the same time.</p>\n<p>Return the result table in <strong>any</strong> order.</p>\n<p>The result format is in the following example.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<p>Input: <br/>UserActivity table:</p><div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>username</th><th>activity</th><th>startDate</th><th>endDate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Alice</td><td>Travel</td><td>2020-02-12</td><td>2020-02-20</td></tr><tr><td>Alice</td><td>Dancing</td><td>2020-02-21</td><td>2020-02-23</td></tr><tr><td>Alice</td><td>Travel</td><td>2020-02-24</td><td>2020-02-28</td></tr><tr><td>Bob</td><td>Travel</td><td>2020-02-11</td><td>2020-02-18</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Output:</p><div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>username</th><th>activity</th><th>startDate</th><th>endDate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Alice</td><td>Dancing</td><td>2020-02-21</td><td>2020-02-23</td></tr><tr><td>Bob</td><td>Travel</td><td>2020-02-11</td><td>2020-02-18</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Explanation: <br/>The most recent activity of Alice is Travel from 2020-02-24 to 2020-02-28, before that she was dancing from 2020-02-21 to 2020-02-23.<br/>Bob only has one record, we just take that one.</p>\n",
